  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - '* Being feral felt so weird.'
  - '* Everything I did was in this\n  weird desperation to survive.'
  - '* Case in point: ^05I know what\n  tree bark tastes like now.'
  - '* ...^05 why?'
  - '* I ate a whole tree.'
